{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1000_407bnp", "source_sha256": "7d3255b679cdcb9301e2f3f5de614c28ac2f269dd76560cb035093fdf3c8ae50", "ja": "誰か残ってると思ったら……このみさん、\nこんな時間までどうしたんですか？", "zh": "我还以为有人没走……原来是木实小姐，\n这么晚了，您怎么还在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "6c375dc1a6153497a4684c8d68d4316f3c26a85888d62341b4ce7cb1acc56bb8", "ja": "あら、プロデューサー。こんなって……\nえっ？　もうこんな時間だったの？", "zh": "哎呀，制作人。你说“这么晚”……咦？已经这么晚了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1002_407bnp", "source_sha256": "cccd1ffa28fee8284e3795a9769b754a372bc7781ef991136717bb6f123f571b", "ja": "もしかして、何か困り事でも？", "zh": "难道是遇到什么困难了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "5bb2461e3794461188a6c276a2ead7fbc5e794bc68c7412ce82636388af74b20", "ja": "困ってるってほどじゃないんだけど……\nちょっと最近の若者文化について調べてたの。", "zh": "倒也算不上有什么烦恼……\n只是稍微查了查最近的年轻人文化啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1004_407bnp", "source_sha256": "e97b05efd9784c13466a7267ca0bef735c9d9c9bfed0e15cc7f3d88b44c0137f", "ja": "若者って。このみさんだって若いじゃないですか。", "zh": "说什么年轻人啊，木实也很年轻嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "ba392831efc120e5a96317dac1e943007a6e781d70869ac436faa0d8dfcf2284", "ja": "それがね、この間、百合子ちゃんと桃子ちゃんと\nカラオケに行ったんだけど……。", "zh": "其实啊，前些天我和百合子、小桃一起去唱卡拉OK了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "c5e2c1d7da12dae2e57a636cbd7e34f3064afa7fff0dee678e5a46cc766d0b96", "ja": "いろいろ世代の違いを感じちゃったのよ。ふたりは\n私のアダルティなカラオケについて来れなくて。", "zh": "不知不觉就感受到了各种各样的代沟。两个人都跟不上我那成熟系的卡拉OK风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1007_407bnp", "source_sha256": "5e1b8febfebd2784a8e6b3cd2710397d05812dd2bcdb4b96fd2aad1bf3d6ab1f", "ja": "ああ……確かにカラオケの曲選びって難しいですよね。\n社会に出ると、メンバー次第で変えたりもするし。", "zh": "啊……确实，卡拉OK选歌很难呢。\n步入社会后，也会根据一起唱歌的人来调整歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "7e18a87bc0c52be12be544b4b5f5420860fa5f3d267fd018a827c97822ca631f", "ja": "そうなの！　単に旬ならOKってものでも\nなかったりするじゃない？", "zh": "就是嘛！选当下流行的歌也不一定就行，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "67e2e52a7c74083d73ea50ed5903fe189e03c0f83ee5bf96b2c56a0a23202206", "ja": "でも、それだけじゃなくて……。ふたりとはユニットの\n仲間として、これから長く一緒に頑張っていきたいし。", "zh": "不过，不只是因为正当红就可以……我也想作为组合的伙伴，今后和她们两个人一起长久努力下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "1e6670e3a9e305fdbdb66a5ce8aca7ac760af71e285c644c1d0fe342068845a6", "ja": "だから、もっといろんなことに共感したり、なんでも\n気楽に、たくさん話せるようになりたいのよね。", "zh": "所以，我也想在更多事情上产生共鸣，今后能轻松地和她们聊很多各种各样的话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1011_407bnp", "source_sha256": "cee149fc59bbd4284e5bebc836f2f04507c5fe19698ef05616a989c8af87e96b", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことだったんですね。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "038fee9cc90816a048d96c9fbe945e760192dca3b93401b888453ab4834892fc", "ja": "今の子たちって何が好きなのかしら。\n共通の話題にできそうなのは、うーん……。ん？", "zh": "现在的孩子们都喜欢些什么呢？\n要找个大家都能聊的话题，嗯……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "5f502d684d0ec3ecfa5cb832a30c8791225b113dfe21ece9c393657bf4c59f3d", "ja": "そういえば、プロデューサーはどうしてるの？\n私たち、それこそ大人から子供までいるわけじゃない。", "zh": "说起来，制作人是怎么应付的呢？\n我们这边可是从大人到孩子都有的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "0ef252db2f52cb32ff89c08a7821a41b5da5b0e33e5057ff37abb09847065250", "ja": "もしかして、すっごく無理して\n話を合わせてくれてたりするの！？", "zh": "难道说，你其实一直在非常勉强地迎合我们的话题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1015_407bnp", "source_sha256": "726344c423b8ec6418b17ae28911f2e0988de8ab8d086a009b3a25fce2078c52", "ja": "いえいえ、そんな無理はしていませんよ。そもそも、\n無理して話を合わせても、ボロが出そうなので……。", "zh": "没有没有，我并没有那样勉强自己啦。而且说到底，\n就算硬去迎合话题，感觉也迟早会露出破绽的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1016_407bnp", "source_sha256": "f68c32f6755a92daf0523c50b612d99e8c85178feb7fadb38761cdb4d43e6689", "ja": "正直に、誠実に向き合おうとは思ってます。\n……それくらいですよ。", "zh": "我只是想着，要坦诚、真诚地面对。  \n……也就这样而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "8e23035c1776496070a0703bfa1872c2017e1caada2565266613bae56fa8ac40", "ja": "そう……。そうよね。\n結局、それが一番なのかも。", "zh": "是啊……你说得对。\n说到底，或许这样才是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "5e8e06bc50db88a9f5efe3f7317f945277f491f54de229fbeadb6ae837b01c10", "ja": "私もふたりに正直に、誠実に向き合うことにするわ。\nありがと、プロデューサー♪", "zh": "我也会坦诚、真诚地面对那两个人。谢谢你，制作人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1019_407bnp", "source_sha256": "2aa816c97163bdb3d05d7a0537dbdd985b25828f02e498001806afa9661b91aa", "ja": "とんでもない。むしろ申し訳ないです。\nアイドルなのに気を使わせてしまって。", "zh": "哪里的话。该道歉的是我才对。明明你们是偶像，却还让你们费心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "97c52ee872319212561f97f2f43cde9a2c3e40439254889e9b150425389ea557", "ja": "あら。そんな風に思ってくれてるなら、大人同士として\nこれから1杯付き合ってもらおうかしら。", "zh": "哎呀。既然你是这么想的，那接下来就以成年人的身份陪我喝上1杯，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1021_407bnp", "source_sha256": "7034a8a013d28880423ca0b781d634cca0480df35bda704fe9a46518dc41d646", "ja": "あ、すみません、今日は少し残業していこうかと。\nまあ今日締めの仕事でもないんですけどね。", "zh": "啊，不好意思，我今天想稍微加会儿班。虽然也不是什么今天必须完成的工作就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "5630add1ac3e80f1bd6eae201f70b519eeb5238b07cf75e6c0e21e0749c0d3cc", "ja": "じゃあ問題ないわね。すぐ行きましょう♪", "zh": "那就没问题了。我们马上走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1023_407bnp", "source_sha256": "b1886e7d4de9a41ec4c80470ba23c0afd4d39e02d481138a025e0238f24c080b", "ja": "えっ？　いや、あの……。", "zh": "诶？不，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0493_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "3654c5f965bb6a47918f85915ec24c6ebf4f13aa07bf5cdb966c20dd6cf0740f", "ja": "『明日できることは明日やる』健全な会社員の鉄則よ♪\n大丈夫、1杯だけだから。たまには……、ね？", "zh": "“明天能做的事就明天再做”——这是健康上班族的铁则哦♪\n没关系，才喝1杯而已。偶尔一次……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
